 "_doc": "Crystal only: caught location = party struct byte 0x1E & 0x7F (a LANDMARK_* id). 0 = none/not recorded (Gold/Silver always 0), 0x7E = gift, 0x7F = event. Byte 0x1D: bits 7-6 time of day (1 morning, 2 day, 3 night), bits 5-0 caught level. Byte 0x1E bit 7 = OT gender (1 = female).",
